\paragraph{Symbolic Mirage Hypothesis: verification.}
\looseness=-1 The observations and prediction of \S\ref{sec:mirage} are confirmed. Observations O1--O2, initially discovered on Mistral-7B, generalize: BR $> 1$ across three self-extraction models, six cross-model pairs, and all eight cells of a $2{\times}2$ generator${\times}$extractor matrix (\S\ref{sec:confirmation-bias}); 27 training-free strategies fail to reduce BR below 1.0 (\S\ref{sec:remediation}). Prediction P1 is validated: cross-architecture NLI escapes the mirage when the verifier exceeds the generator (\S\ref{sec:cross-arch}).
